/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/extension/instrumentation/InstrumentationModule.java"],"commit":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783","commits":[{"changed_paths":["javaagent-extension-api/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/extension/instrumentation/InstrumentationModule.java"],"commit":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783","parent":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","subject":"Document unconditional instrumentation selector ordering","tree":"66434454592ca8a68e06ca22a3fb81aa3df95b8c"}],"cumulative_patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","finding_commits":{"review:5510062683":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783"},"parent":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","tree":"66434454592ca8a68e06ca22a3fb81aa3df95b8c"},"confirmed_at":1791941028,"effect":"push","generation":1,"request_id":"f828b39daf744c64908d02e2a7830d9b","sha":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783"}],"reason":"fresh_Copilot_review_request_intent","report":{"artifact_id":11862554683,"candidate":{"bundle_sha256":"c48e266dd5de7dc10110c1de22b451427d5a5a62d453647c0e8787095fbde3df","changed":true,"changed_paths":["javaagent-extension-api/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/extension/instrumentation/InstrumentationModule.java"],"commit":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783","commits":[{"changed_paths":["javaagent-extension-api/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/extension/instrumentation/InstrumentationModule.java"],"commit":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783","parent":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","subject":"Document unconditional instrumentation selector ordering","tree":"66434454592ca8a68e06ca22a3fb81aa3df95b8c"}],"cumulative_patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","finding_commits":{"review:5510062683":"49e25d004b3d35ab28084269b9114b0a098ed783"},"parent":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","patch_sha256":"98728c2def951ce3b6330efd9750718fc2923ed3cb4060576337f305a2229346","tree":"66434454592ca8a68e06ca22a3fb81aa3df95b8c"},"dispositions":{"findings":[{"analysis":"The InstrumentationModule constructor contract incorrectly limited versioned-first ordering to v3 preview and claimed compatibility-alias precedence outside preview. The constructor preserves supplied name order, VertxWebInstrumentationModule registers versioned-first names unconditionally, and both flat and declarative enablement resolve the first configured name without preview gating. Removed both obsolete qualifications from the public Javadoc; executable source is unchanged.","commit":1,"disposition":"fixed","key":"review:5510062683"}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"d053b7907bccecc74a6e5136275915d56c995dda95afc15a9db15099664cdd25","schema":2},"download_sha256":"af69d771b693e3c375750109c0f02c60dd173ce8fb06937d5705c5dab7d6d7d7","frozen_sha":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","pr":20582,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","request_digest":"d053b7907bccecc74a6e5136275915d56c995dda95afc15a9db15099664cdd25","request_id":"f828b39daf744c64908d02e2a7830d9b","run_attempt":1,"run_id":38493449969,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:af69d771b693e3c375750109c0f02c60dd173ce8fb06937d5705c5dab7d6d7d7","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":38495353679},"workflow_revision":"5d6ad62b673c0c9d4746d35b84ef1beb64efd265"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5508946250,5509544158,5510062683],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udd35 Needs a closer look\n\nThis broad breaking selector migration spans many modules, and the shared public selector contract remains outdated.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Update InstrumentationModule Javadoc for unconditional versioned-first ordering</summary>\n\n`instrumentation/\u200bvertx/\u200bvertx-web-3.0/\u200bjavaagent/\u200bsrc/\u200bmain/\u200bjava/\u200bio/\u200bopentelemetry/\u200bjavaagent/\u200binstrumentation/\u200bvertx/\u200bweb/\u200bv3_0/\u200bVertxWebInstrumentationModule.java:19`\n\n[Javaagent] Making the versioned-first hierarchy unconditional leaves the public `InstrumentationModule` constructor contract inaccurate: its Javadoc still says this ordering applies only under `otel.instrumentation.common.v3-preview=true` and that compatibility aliases retain precedence outside preview (`javaagent-extension-api/.../InstrumentationModule.java:46-78`). Please update that contract as part of this migration so extension authors are not given behavior that these constructors no longer implement.\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5510062683","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5510062683}],"frozen_at":1791939659,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-14T01:00:59Z","frozen_sha":"e6531bbdeff7f9423a21d54c4b88b5ef34d15dca","head_ref":"trask-v3-module-naming-pr","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":38493370123},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","metadata":{"body":"<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->\n\nUse versioned-first Java agent instrumentation names unconditionally and remove legacy and implementation-only enablement aliases. Part of #20510.\n\n```properties\n# Before\notel.instrumentation.cxf-3.2.enabled=false\n# After\notel.instrumentation.jaxrs-2.0-cxf-3.2.enabled=false\n```\n\nVersioned component selectors now take precedence over role, versionless, and umbrella selectors. Shared component selectors control all of their implementations; CHANGELOG.md lists replacements and changed umbrella membership.\n\nRemoves the internal `DeprecatedInstrumentationNames` extension helper. Emitted scope names and declarative selector spelling changes are separate PRs.","title":"Use versioned-first instrumentation names and remove legacy aliases"},"mode":"publish","pr":20582,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791939660,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"7826ac20144c4508980e0ff13ee16297","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"f828b39daf744c64908d02e2a7830d9b","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/5d6ad62b673c0c9d4746d35b84ef1beb64efd265","workflow_revision":"5d6ad62b673c0c9d4746d35b84ef1beb64efd265"},"review_request":{"baseline_review_ids":[5508946250,5509544158,5510062683],"baseline_run_ids":[38495484757,38495484785,38495484811,38495484881,38495485128,38495485205],"claim":"b3f1df346ef14b7b8b9fdf9c